From 6dea5c6e3b079c8e103a459cfb9f8546636210e0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Niccol=C3=B2=20Venerandi?= <niccolo@venerandi.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 20:26:01 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] libnotificationmanager: keep the notification history across
 restarts

The history only lived in plasmashell's memory, so restarting it or a
crash emptied it. Save the notifications to a state file when they
change and restore them as expired entries when the server starts.

BUG: 486483
---
